<title>POLAND: PLI operating turns to loss in Q2.</title>
<headline>PLI operating turns to loss in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLI preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			   1.07 vs	1.22</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.28 vs	1.04</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: PLI SA. Company did not report its net profit.</p>
<p>    net sales				 14.99 vs	9.38</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  12.81 vs	6.61</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.44 vs	0.36</p>
<p>    other taxes				2.84 vs	0.68</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    32.56 vs	0.02</p>
<p>    financial costs			 27.21 vs	0.20</p>
<p>    investment				 2.33 vs	0.10</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.18 vs	1.90</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.84 vs	1.62</p>
<p>    net sales				 26.29 vs     16.87</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  20.41 vs     12.05</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.56 vs	0.54</p>
<p>    other taxes				3.28 vs	1.08</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    33.30 vs	0.09</p>
<p>    financial costs			 28.64 vs	0.37</p>
<p>    investment				 8.20 vs	0.23</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
